cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  sptrends provides independent spatial-autocorrelation diagnostics and
  implements two published trend workflows. Please cite whichever
  you used: True Significant Trends (TST) -- selective AR(1)
  prewhitening, Contextual Mann-Kendall, Theil-Sen, and adaptive FDR
  correction, via workflow_tst() -- described in the first reference
  below; or Robust Trend Analysis (RTA) -- Theil-Sen, Contextual
  Mann-Kendall, and standard FDR-BH, without prewhitening, via
  workflow_rta() -- described in the second. Cite both if you used
  both. User-configured, validated, non-published combinations of the same
  trend-analysis components are available exclusively through workflow_trends();
  cite the component methods actually used.
type: software
title: "sptrends: Statistical Inference for Spatiotemporal Trends in Gridded Data"
